_refine_ls_abs_structure_details
;
In order to be able to confirm the absolute structure of the molecule, data was 
collected using Cu radiation.  On the basis of 975 unmerged 
Friedel opposites, the Flack parameter was determined to be unreliable 
(Flack, 1983 & 2000).  The absolute structure was confirmed using Bayesian 
statistics on 953 select Bijvoet pairs (Hooft, Straver & Spek, 2008).  The 
Hooft y parameter was determined to be 0.09(6).  This supports the given 
absolute structure configuration with negligible contribution from the racemate.
;
